{
  "name": "ICP 多轮回归集（三）确定性计算、范围外、无证据与澄清恢复",
  "version": "2026-09-03",
  "description": "32 组多轮对话：FTA/RBD 确定性计算与追问、范围外问题的连续拒答、相关但资料未记载时的不编造、歧义澄清后的恢复。确定性用例的期望值来自 test-docs 中已给出的合成计算结果；合成数据不代表真实适航知识。",
  "defaults": {
    "assertions": {
      "min_evidence": 1,
      "min_citations": 1,
      "required_event_types": ["answer", "done"],
      "answer_not_contains": [
        "待复核（未绑定已批准直接证据）",
        "证据边界：部分说明未附可直接核验的来源"
      ]
    }
  },
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "MT-FTA-01-startup-cutsets",
      "metadata": {"category": "FTA 确定性分析", "coverage": ["fta_query", "fta_analyzer"], "expected_records": ["FTA-SYN-001"], "expected_value": "3.771e-04"},
      "turns": [
        {"id": "cutsets", "question": "以“系统无法完成启动”为顶事件，最小割集有哪些？顶事件近似概率是多少？",
         "assertions": {"required_scope_routes": ["knowledge_base"], "required_tools": ["fta_query", "fta_analyzer"], "forbidden_tools": ["graph_traversal"], "required_doc_types": ["fta"], "answer_regex": ["最小割集|割集", "3\\.?771e-?04"]}},
        {"id": "events", "question": "这些基本事件里，哪些属于电源子系统？分别对应哪些 FMECA 故障模式？",
         "assertions": {"required_tools": ["fta_query"], "required_used_doc_types": ["fta"], "any_used_record_ids": ["FTA-SYN-001"], "answer_regex": ["ICU|PSU|PDU|HUM|电源", "FM-SYN"]}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MT-FTA-02-external-comms",
